      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Johnson & Johnson analytics teams faced a bottleneck: patient data arrived in Excel files with varying structures, formats and sizes, requiring manual cleanup before analysis. HumbleBeeAI developed the Patient Report Analyzer to automate parsing and cleaning across those files. The source-reported outcomes are an 80% reduction in preprocessing/manual work and a separate 50% processing improvement; the case study is a website snapshot with owner approval and publication approval pending, and the figures have not been independently validated."
