            {
              "key": "section_3",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 3
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Adaptive parsing and data cleaning"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The Analyzer’s parsing adapts to renamed columns and restructured sheets, while cleaning algorithms handle inconsistencies. These capabilities target the varied file structures and manual preparation that impeded analysis."
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "sourceCitation",
                      "attrs": {
                        "sourceChunkId": "0b330d22-3eac-44f6-8bfc-74e99ec7953c"
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "sourceCitation",
                      "attrs": {
