      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "HumbleBeeAI designed and implemented a customized labeling platform for a computer vision service provider serving more than 15 enterprise clients. The client needed isolated environments, secure data handling and model-assisted workflows for varied annotation work. The case study reports delivery of 15+ isolated annotation environments and a 75% reduction in annotation time. These are source-reported figures, not independently validated; owner approval remains pending."
