      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Each customer required a platform tailored to its specifications, strict data isolation and security, creating operational complexity as the provider managed large annotation projects. Its existing infrastructure faced difficulty scaling isolated deployments and concurrent model processing across annotation types; GPU memory use and auto-labeling performance were also reported as concerns. The work covered object detection, segmentation, video tracking and keypoint analysis, among other needs. The source describes difficulty with the earlier infrastructure but does not quantify its baseline workload, annotation hours or performance."
            },
            {
              "type": "sourceCitation",
