              "text": "The case study reports 15+ isolated environments, a 75% reduction in annotation time for ML-assisted versus manual labeling, and 90%+ labeling accuracy attributed to specialized models and validation workflows. The source does not provide the annotation sample size, baseline hours, accuracy definition or evaluation sample, so the figures cannot be independently assessed from the supplied evidence. The reported 15+ figure is a deployment count, not an accuracy sample."
            },
            {
              "type": "sourceCitation",
              "attrs": {
