              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "The source also claims 99.9% data-protection reliability for configurable backups and GCS integration, and says migration times fell from days to hours. However, reliability is undefined and the evidence supplied gives no test conditions or measurement method; this figure is therefore not presented as a substantiated portfolio result. Migration timing likewise lacks comparison details. No further measurement data or independent validation has been provided."
                },
                {
                  "type": "sourceCitation",
                  "attrs": {
                    "sourceChunkId": "8b8b39d1-1e6f-4139-9a9a-4b2b2c1f0032"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " "
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Original case study",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "https://humblebee.ai/case-studies/data-labeling-tool"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardBreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "The source describes advanced analytics dashboards and deeper MLOps integrations as enhancements being explored, not delivered capabilities. No approved next-step plan is supplied. The case study text has been reviewed, but owner approval is pending."
                },
                {
                  "type": "sourceCitation",
                  "attrs": {
