          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The team expanded and diversified the training dataset with real-world retail footage, applying scaling, random cropping, color and brightness variation, and geometric transformations. It also analyzed error distributions and confidence variance across object categories to iteratively refine sampling strategies and model architectures. "
